          >StudioCMS</a
        >, and docs for <a
          href='https://docs.astro.build'
          target='_blank'
          class='text-accent border-accent-dim border-b hover:opacity-80'
          >Astro</a
        >, <a
          href='https://starlight.astro.build'
          target='_blank'
          class='text-accent border-accent-dim border-b hover:opacity-80'
          >Starlight</a
        >, and <a
          href='https://tauri.app'
          target='_blank'
          class='text-accent border-accent-dim border-b hover:opacity-80'
          >Tauri</a
        >.
      </p> -->
      <p class='text-dim mt-4 max-w-[58ch]'>
        Got something interesting? <a
          href='/contact'
          class='text-accent border-accent-dim border-b hover:opacity-80'
          >Let's talk</a
        >.
      </p>
      <div
        class='border-border text-dim mt-11 flex w-fit border text-[12.5px]'
      >
        <span class='text-green-500 px-3.5 py-1.5'>
          <span
            aria-hidden='true'
            class='motion-safe:animate-[breathe_2.4s_ease-in-out_infinite]'
          >●</span> open to collab
        </span>
        <span class='border-border border-l px-3.5 py-1.5'>tz UTC−3</span>
        <span class='border-border border-l px-3.5 py-1.5'
          >uptime 4y in OSS</span
        >
      </div>

      <div class='mt-10'>
        <div class='text-dim prompt-glyph text-sm'>echo $TECH</div>
        <ul class='mt-4 flex max-w-[58ch] flex-wrap gap-2'>
          {
            stack.map((tech) => (
              <li
                class='tag border-border bg-panel border px-2.5 py-1 text-[12.5px]'
                style={`--tag: ${tech.color}`}
              >
                {tech.name}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='mt-16'>
      <h2 class='text-dim prompt-glyph mb-6 text-sm font-medium lowercase'>
        ls <span class='text-ink'>./projects</span> -la | head -4
      </h2>
      <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-3.5 md:grid-cols-2'>
        {
          projects.slice(0, 4).map((project) => (
            <a
              href={project.link}
              target='_blank'
              class='border-border bg-panel hover:border-accent-dim block border p-5 transition-colors'
            >
              <div class='text-ink text-[15px] font-bold'>
                <span class='text-accent'>▪ </span>
                {project.name}
              </div>
              <p class='text-dim mt-2 min-h-[3.4em] text-[13.5px]'>
                {project.description}
              </p>
              <div class='text-faint mt-3 text-xs'>
                <span aria-hidden='true' style={`color: ${project.langColor}`}>
                  ●
                </span>{' '}
                {project.meta}
              </div>
              <div class='bg-bg border-border text-dim mt-3 overflow-hidden border border-dashed px-3 py-2 text-[12.5px] text-ellipsis whitespace-nowrap'>
                <span class='text-accent'>$ </span>
                {project.cmd}
              </div>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
       <a
          href='https://github.com/ivanfarias-tech'
          target='_blank'
          rel='noreferrer'
          class='text-dim hover:text-accent mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px]'
        >
          <span>more projects on github</span>
          <span aria-hidden='true'>→</span>

          <svg
            viewBox='0 0 24 24'
            aria-hidden='true'
            class='h-4 w-4'
            fill='currentColor'
          >
            <path
              d='M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.58 2 12.23c0 4.52 2.87 8.35 6.84 9.71.5.1.68-.22.68-.49
              0-.24-.01-.89-.01-1.74-2.78.62-3.37-1.38-3.37-1.38-.45-1.2-1.11-1.52-1.11-1.52
              -.91-.64.07-.63.07-.63 1 .07 1.53 1.06 1.53 1.06.89 1.57 2.34 1.12 2.91.86
              .09-.67.35-1.12.63-1.38-2.22-.26-4.55-1.14-4.55-5.07 0-1.12.39-2.03 1.03-2.75
              -.1-.26-.45-1.3.1-2.71 0 0 .84-.28 2.75 1.05A9.15 9.15 0 0 1 12 6.15
              c.85 0 1.7.12 2.49.37 1.91-1.33 2.75-1.05 2.75-1.05.55 1.41.2 2.45.1 2.71
              .64.72 1.03 1.63 1.03 2.75 0 3.94-2.34 4.8-4.57 5.06.36.32.68.95.68 1.92
              0 1.38-.01 2.49-.01 2.83 0 .27.18.59.69.49A10.25 10.25 0 0 0 22 12.23
              C22 6.58 17.52 2 12 2Z'
            />
          </svg>
        </a>
    </section>

    <section class='mt-20'>
      <h2 class='text-dim prompt-glyph mb-6 text-sm font-medium lowercase'>
        ls <span class='text-ink'>./posts</span> -la | head -5
      </h2>
      <div class='border-border bg-panel border'>
        {
          latest.map(({ post, minutes }) => (
            <a
              href={`/posts/${post.id}`}
              class='border-border hover:bg-tint group grid grid-cols-[85px_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-b px-4 py-3.5 text-sm last:border-b-0 md:grid-cols-[110px_1fr_auto] md:gap-5 md:px-5'
            >
              <span class='text-faint text-[12.5px]'>
                {formatDate(post.data.pubDate)}
              </span>
              <span class='text-ink group-hover:text-accent'>
                {post.data.title}
              </span>
              <span class='text-faint hidden text-[12.5px] md:block'>{minutes}</span>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <a
        href='/posts'
        class='text-dim hover:text-accent mt-4 inline-block text-[13px]'
      >
        <span class='text-accent'>❯</span> cd /posts →
      </a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
